    {
      "text": "Sarah Chen",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "#111827"
    },
    {
      "text": "Building a Real-Time Collaboration Engine",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#607EBC"
    },
    {
      "text": "10 minutes ago",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#9CA3AF"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is incredibly well-written! The section on conflict resolution with CRDTs cleared up a lot of confusion I had. Would love to see a follow-up on handling large document state.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#6B7280",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Marcus Johnson",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "#111827"
    },
    {
      "text": "Optimizing React Renders at Scale",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#607EBC"
    },
    {
      "text": "1 hour ago",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#9CA3AF"
    },
    {
      "text": "We implemented a similar virtualization strategy at our company. One thing I'd add is that React.memo can actually hurt performance in some cases if the comparison function is expensive.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#6B7280",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Yuki Tanaka",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "#111827"
    },
    {
      "text": "Type-Safe API Layers with tRPC",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#607EBC"
    },
    {
      "text": "3 hours ago",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#9CA3AF"
    },
    {
      "text": "Switched our entire API layer to tRPC after reading this. The DX improvement was instant. One question: how do you handle file uploads with tRPC?",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#6B7280",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
    {
      "text": "David Park",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "#111827"
    },
    {
      "text": "From Monolith to Microservices",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#607EBC"
    },
    {
      "text": "5 hours ago",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#9CA3AF"
    },
    {
      "text": "Great pragmatic approach. Too many articles push for a complete rewrite. The strangler fig pattern you described saved us months of work.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontWeight": "400",
